<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>62.0</apiVersion>
    <assignments>
        <name>Append_Measurement_Line</name>
        <label>측정 라인 텍스트 누적</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>600</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>Measurement_Summary</assignToReference>
            <operator>Add</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Line_Text</elementReference>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Loop_Measurements</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </assignments>
    <constants>
        <name>Fallback_Channel_Id</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <value>
            <stringValue>C0BTGS2BQLW</stringValue>
        </value>
    </constants>
    <constants>
        <name>Lightning_Host</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <value>
            <stringValue>https://trailsignup-8617b18a6871a9.lightning.force.com/</stringValue>
        </value>
    </constants>
    <decisions>
        <name>Check_Slack_Alert_Enabled</name>
        <label>Slack Alert 활성 확인</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>240</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Off(종료)</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Slack_Alert_On</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Feature_Flag_Setting.Slack_Alert__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Measurement_Lines</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Slack Alert On</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>Check_Swarm_Channel_Found</name>
        <label>Swarm 채널 존재 확인</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>840</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Send_Fallback_DM_Alert</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>없음(임시 채널 폴백)</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Swarm_Channel_Exists</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Swarm_For_Case.CollaborationUrl</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Send_Swarm_Completion_Alert</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Swarm 채널 있음</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>복구 WorkOrder가 완료(Status=Completed)되면 해당 Case의 Swarm 채널로 완료 보고를 발신. Feature Flag(T5_Feature_Flags__mdt.Default.Slack_Alert__c) Off면 미발신. CaseId 있는 WO만 대상. WOLI에서 측정 결과(포인트·측정값·단위·판정)를 조립해 메시지 본문에 포함. Swarm(RelatedRecordId=CaseId, Status!=Closed)의 CollaborationUrl에서 Slack 채널 ID 추출 후 T5_Send_Slack_Channel_Message subflow 재사용해 발신. Swarm 없으면 임시 채널(Fallback_Channel_Id) 폴백. Case는 닫지 않음(고객 복구 확인·RCA 별도). Slack 콜아웃은 Record-Triggered 즉시 경로 불가로 AsyncAfterCommit 경로 실행. WorkOrder에 쓰기 없음(순수 알림). T5-29 / T5-33.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>Line_Text</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>BR() &amp; &quot;• &quot; &amp; IF(ISBLANK({!Loop_Measurements.Measurement_Point__c}), &quot;-&quot;, {!Loop_Measurements.Measurement_Point__c}) &amp; &quot; : &quot; &amp; IF(ISBLANK({!Loop_Measurements.Measured_Value__c}), &quot;-&quot;, TEXT({!Loop_Measurements.Measured_Value__c})) &amp; &quot; &quot; &amp; IF(ISBLANK({!Loop_Measurements.Unit__c}), &quot;&quot;, {!Loop_Measurements.Unit__c}) &amp; &quot; → &quot; &amp; IF(ISBLANK(TEXT({!Loop_Measurements.Judgement__c})), &quot;-&quot;, TEXT({!Loop_Measurements.Judgement__c}))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Swarm_Channel_Id</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
  FIND(&apos;/archives/&apos;, {!Get_Swarm_For_Case.CollaborationUrl}) &gt; 0,
  LEFT(
    MID( {!Get_Swarm_For_Case.CollaborationUrl}, FIND(&apos;/archives/&apos;, {!Get_Swarm_For_Case.CollaborationUrl}) + 10, 255 ),
    FIND(&apos;/&apos;, MID( {!Get_Swarm_For_Case.CollaborationUrl}, FIND(&apos;/archives/&apos;, {!Get_Swarm_For_Case.CollaborationUrl}) + 10, 255 ) &amp; &apos;/&apos;) - 1
  ),
  MID(
    {!Get_Swarm_For_Case.CollaborationUrl},
    FIND(&apos;/client/&apos;, {!Get_Swarm_For_Case.CollaborationUrl}) + 9 + FIND(&apos;/&apos;, MID({!Get_Swarm_For_Case.CollaborationUrl}, FIND(&apos;/client/&apos;, {!Get_Swarm_For_Case.CollaborationUrl}) + 9, 255)),
    255
  )
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>T5 WorkOrder Completed Swarm Notify {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>T5 WorkOrder Completed Swarm Notify</label>
    <loops>
        <name>Loop_Measurements</name>
        <label>측정 항목 순회</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>480</locationY>
        <collectionReference>Get_Measurement_Lines</collectionReference>
        <iterationOrder>Asc</iterationOrder>
        <nextValueConnector>
            <targetReference>Append_Measurement_Line</targetReference>
        </nextValueConnector>
        <noMoreValuesConnector>
            <targetReference>Get_Swarm_For_Case</targetReference>
        </noMoreValuesConnector>
    </loops>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_Feature_Flag_Setting</name>
        <label>Feature Flag 조회</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>120</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Check_Slack_Alert_Enabled</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>DeveloperName</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Default</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>T5_Feature_Flags__mdt</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Slack_Alert__c</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_Measurement_Lines</name>
        <label>측정 항목(WOLI) 조회</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>360</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Loop_Measurements</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>1 AND 2</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>WorkOrderId</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Measurement_Point__c</field>
            <operator>IsNull</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>false</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>WorkOrderLineItem</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>LineItemNumber</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Measurement_Point__c</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Measured_Value__c</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Unit__c</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Judgement__c</queriedFields>
        <sortField>LineItemNumber</sortField>
        <sortOrder>Asc</sortOrder>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_Swarm_For_Case</name>
        <label>Case의 Swarm 조회</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>720</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Check_Swarm_Channel_Found</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>1 AND 2</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>RelatedRecordId</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.CaseId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Status</field>
            <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Closed</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Swarm</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>CollaborationUrl</queriedFields>
        <sortField>CreatedDate</sortField>
        <sortOrder>Desc</sortOrder>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordUpdates>
        <name>Update_Case_Stage</name>
        <label>Case 진행 단계를 RCA·예방·지식으로</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>120</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_Feature_Flag_Setting</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>1 AND 2</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.CaseId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Stage__c</field>
            <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>5 RCA·예방·지식</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Stage__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>5 RCA·예방·지식</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Case</object>
    </recordUpdates>
    <start>
        <locationX>50</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>true</doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>
        <filterFormula>AND( ISPICKVAL({!$Record.Status}, &apos;Completed&apos;), NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.CaseId})) )</filterFormula>
        <object>WorkOrder</object>
        <recordTriggerType>Update</recordTriggerType>
        <scheduledPaths>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Update_Case_Stage</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <pathType>AsyncAfterCommit</pathType>
        </scheduledPaths>
        <triggerType>RecordAfterSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
    <subflows>
        <name>Send_Fallback_DM_Alert</name>
        <label>Slack 발신 (임시 채널 폴백)</label>
        <locationX>300</locationX>
        <locationY>960</locationY>
        <flowName>T5_Send_Slack_Channel_Message</flowName>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>channelId</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Fallback_Channel_Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>messageText</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Msg_WO_Completed</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
    </subflows>
    <subflows>
        <name>Send_Swarm_Completion_Alert</name>
        <label>Slack 발신 (Swarm 채널)</label>
        <locationX>50</locationX>
        <locationY>960</locationY>
        <flowName>T5_Send_Slack_Channel_Message</flowName>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>channelId</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Swarm_Channel_Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>messageText</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Msg_WO_Completed</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
    </subflows>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>Msg_WO_Completed</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>:white_check_mark: [복구 작업 완료 보고] {!$Record.Subject}
작업지시: {!$Record.WorkOrderNumber}
자산: {!$Record.Asset.Name}
완료 시각: {!$Record.LastModifiedDate}
연결 Case: {!$Record.Case.CaseNumber}

조치 내용: {!$Record.Action_Taken__c}
복구 결과: {!$Record.Repair_Result__c}

:bar_chart: 측정 결과{!Measurement_Summary}

:warning: 이 완료 알림만으로 Case를 종결하지 않습니다. 고객 복구 확인과 RCA가 남아 있습니다.
WorkOrder: {!Lightning_Host}lightning/r/WorkOrder/{!$Record.Id}/view</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <variables>
        <name>Measurement_Summary</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>false</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
        <value>
            <stringValue></stringValue>
        </value>
    </variables>
</Flow>
